{"ts":"2026-07-11T22:55:46.032Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"GH-519 (open, enhancement + agent-experience labels, pm 2026.7.11). With governance-require-close-reason + strict close validation, pm close on an item lacking resolution fields emits missing: --validate-close and suggested_retry ... --validate-close \"<value>\". Two defects: (1) --validate-close is a mode enum (off|warn|strict) but renders as a free-text placeholder, so following the suggestion is GUARANTEED to fail with Invalid --validate-close mode; (2) the stated gap misdirects — the real blocker (missing resolution, expected_result, actual_result) only surfaces after two failed retries; three invocations to reach the actionable error. This is the third member of the placeholder-ignores-flag-value-domain family: GH-500/pm-6y58 fixed the BOOLEAN arity literally, GH-507/pm-9qcr fixed extension-contract boolean arity, this is the ENUM domain — recovery rendering still has no notion of a flag's value domain. Consider fixing the class (render from the flag's declared contract domain) rather than a third point patch; pm-srns uniform-output-contract territory is adjacent."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ulqu"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-519: close recovery bundle suggests --validate-close \"<value>\" for an enum flag and hides the real resolution-fields blocker"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":2},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","gh-issue"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-11T22:55:46.032Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-11T22:55:46.032Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"suggested_retry renders enum-valued flags with allowed values inline (--validate-close <off|warn|strict>) instead of a generic <value> placeholder; when strict close validation blocks a close, the FIRST error surfaces missing resolution/expected_result/actual_result with a suggested pm update retry carrying those flags; regression specs cover both the enum rendering and the blocker-first ordering; agent reaches the actionable error in 1 invocation instead of 3"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-6y58","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-11T22:55:46.032Z"},{"id":"pm-9qcr","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-11T22:55:46.032Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"8b88f1b9215b18f51ed4f8d91559627ba26f578d76e515f8e10cf74afdd26769","message":""}
